      "id": 1,
      "text": "Golden Valley’s elevation of about 5,100 ft keeps July highs around 87 °F while January lows dip to 21 °F.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
